  "body": "Such exceptions can occur due to custom element constructors or invariant checks. This closes https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/569 by moving the catch-and-return-HTMLUnknownElement from HTML to DOM; HTML will subsequently be updated to remove that logic.\n\n/cc @rniwa @dominiccooney. HTML PR incoming; I am hoping @rniwa can upstream his test changes from https://bugs.webkit.org/attachment.cgi?id=290872&action=prettypatch\n",
